Start with init and supply your authorized account and source references. Connectors must be authorized separately. These are plugin-routed prompt shortcuts; select the plugin in the host when required. Customer email sends require approval of the exact content and window. Factual notification SMS uses standing permission plus current channel, stop, timing and count checks.

Open Aimore/Today for current tasks. Submit Notion reviews/data, then wait for the shared task or run run-auto; no extra continue command. Email/CRM review stays separate from standing notification SMS permission.

SentToNetwork completes SMS sending; no handset confirmation or delivery polling is required.
